cuju-grf-media
Copyright 2026 The cuju Authors (the contributors in the git history of cuju).

This package holds media files of Google Research Football
(https://github.com/google-research/football), commit 3d9e754720a95621bba6475c4d3b0d56fe919014,
copied byte for byte for the software renderer of cuju. cuju/grf_media/manifest.json names each
file, its path in Google Research Football, its size, its SHA-256 and its license.

The models, textures, scene files and menu images descend from Gameplay Football by Bastiaan Konings
Schuiling, 2008 to 2015, which its author dedicated to the public domain under the Unlicense.
LICENSES/Unlicense.txt holds that dedication, and the manifest marks these files Unlicense.

Google Research Football, Copyright 2019 Google LLC, Apache License 2.0, modified Gameplay Football
and its data and converted its images to BMP. Google's changes are licensed under the Apache License
2.0, and the two team logos, which Google added, are marked Apache-2.0 in the manifest. LICENSE
holds that license.

fonts/AlegreyaSansSC-ExtraBold.ttf is Alegreya Sans SC ExtraBold 2.003, Copyright 2013 The Alegreya
Sans Project Authors (https://github.com/huertatipografica/Alegreya-Sans), licensed under the SIL
Open Font License 1.1, which LICENSES/OFL-1.1.txt holds. Files that cuju derives from the font, such
as a glyph atlas, are licensed under the same license.

The 16 adboard images in data/media/textures/adboards are those that Google Research Football
ships. Most of them show the names and logos of third parties, which may be trademarks of their
owners. A dedication to the public domain concerns copyright alone and grants no right in a
trademark. cuju ships the boards so that its frames match those of Google Research Football, and
neither cuju nor this package is affiliated with or endorsed by the owners of those names. The
names of the team images follow those of Google Research Football, and the images show fictional
teams.

cuju is not affiliated with or endorsed by Google.
